cachy-asahi-cache 0.2.0
Copyright (c) 2026 cachy-asahi contributors. MIT License.

Original local cache inspection/protection/selected cleanup implementation.
No-follow FD traversal, stable snapshots, fsync/no-replace publication and guarded
journal replacement adapt the project's MIT cachy-asahi-mirrors patterns.
Copyright and the full MIT grant are retained in LICENSE.

Calls the existing separately provided pacman/libalpm16 system dependency through
its documented public API; no library bytes, package-manager implementation,
repository catalog, signing authority or orphan-removal alias are bundled.
Local protection policy is not signed-release, known-good or recovery authority.
